@startuml data-ownership
title Владение доменными данными и зоны хранения
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "platform-governance\n---\ntenant [green]\nuser-role [green]\naudit-record [green]" as Platform
rectangle "data-governance\n---\nprocessing-basis [red]\nsuppression-entry [red]" as Governance
rectangle "lead-management\n---\ncompany [mixed]\ncontact [red]\nattribute-provenance [red]\nemail-verification [red]\ncompany-size-profile [green]\noutbound-message [green]\nemail-template [green]\nlead-status [green]\nlead-assessment [green]" as Leads
rectangle "audience\n---\nlead-score [red]\nsegment [red]\naudience-snapshot [red]" as Audience
rectangle "content-production\n---\ncontent-asset [green]\ncontent-version [green]\nlanding-content [green]\ndocument [green]\nrender-job [green]" as Content
rectangle "outreach-orchestration\n---\ncampaign [green]\nsequence-definition [green]\nsequence-execution [green]\naction-draft [green]\noperator-decision [green]\ncall [red]" as Outreach
rectangle "message-delivery\n---\nmessage [green]\nsender-reputation [green]" as Delivery
rectangle "request-fulfillment\n---\nrequest aggregate [green]\nrequest / offer [E]\nrequest-execution aggregate [catalog]\nexecution-intent [root] / execution-attempt [E]\nevents: request-execution-failed [request]\nevents: execution-intent-accepted [request-execution]\nplanned only: terminal intent / handoff manifest / delivery receipt" as Requests
rectangle "engagement-observation\n---\nengagement-event [analytics]" as Engagement
rectangle "analytics\n---\nreport-snapshot [analytics]" as Analytics

Platform -[hidden]-> Governance
Governance -[hidden]-> Leads
Leads -[hidden]-> Audience
Audience -[hidden]-> Content
Content -[hidden]-> Outreach
Outreach -[hidden]-> Delivery
Delivery -[hidden]-> Engagement
Engagement -[hidden]-> Requests
Requests -[hidden]-> Analytics

note bottom
  Owner изменяет authoritative state.
  Другие contexts хранят только ID, contract snapshot или собственную projection.
  red = client-controlled storage; mixed = zoning per attribute;
  analytics = обезличенная/агрегированная read model; external = внешний system of record.
end note

note right of Requests
  ExecutionIntent and attempt storage exist;
  the RequestExecution aggregate wrapper is not implemented.
  Terminal intent, handoff manifest and delivery receipt
  are planning targets, not current domain entities/events.
  Оси независимы: request lifecycle status,
  attempt state (ACTIVE/UNKNOWN/terminal),
  доказательность runtime resolution.
  Target resolution не является terminal evidence.
  Только trusted verifier полной Temporal history
  создаёт verified runtime evidence.
  Без verifier-а rerun остаётся blocked.
end note

note right of Outreach
  Editorial decision record belongs to outreach-orchestration
  and references an exact immutable content-version owned by
  content-production. Editorial decision is not delivery approval.
end note

' CTX:platform-governance
' CTX:data-governance
' CTX:lead-management
' CTX:audience
' CTX:content-production
' CTX:outreach-orchestration
' CTX:message-delivery
' CTX:engagement-observation
' CTX:request-fulfillment
' CTX:analytics
@enduml
